00:23:18.070 --> 00:23:20.830
Oh my, what's with the serious look, Tsukiumi?

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:23.630
I was in the middle of planning a new competition that would replace running errands.

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:27.340
Well then, how about a sexy singing contest? Of course, there will be fan service as well.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.730
The Landlady would kill us!

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:29.560
Yoohoo!

00:23:29.560 --> 00:23:31.240
W-Why did you jump in out of nowhere, Kusano?!

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.240
Eighth Wing: Game in the Grass.

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:35.490
Next time, and forever and ever, please!
